# Proof Required (ALWAYS)

Success language is banned without evidence in this turn.

## Required proof

- Paste or summarize real command output for build/test/curl/browser checks.
- Update `.compliance/ledger.json` (hooks also record shell evidence).
- Run `node .compliance/check-ledger.mjs` before claiming done.

## Allowed success phrasing

- "Verified: `npm test` passed (N tests)"
- "Verified: HTTP 200 from `curl …`"
- "Ledger ready_to_declare_done: true"

## Banned without proof

- "should work now"
- "this fixes it"
- "tests can wait"
- "looks good" / "LGTM"
